text Route117_Text_DayCareSign {
    format("POKéMON DAY CARE Let us raise your POKéMON.")
}

text Route117_Text_RouteSignVerdanturf {
    format("ROUTE 117 {LEFT_ARROW} VERDANTURF TOWN")
}

text Route117_Text_RouteSignMauville {
    format("ROUTE 117 {RIGHT_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY")
}


text Route117_Text_AishaDefeat {
    "I don't waste any time being angry\nover a loss--I would rather train."
}

text Route117_Text_AishaIntro {
    "Concentrate on getting the win.\nThat's how I battle!"
}

text Route117_Text_AishaPostBattle {
    "I think that if you worry about losing,\nyou're more likely to lose."
}

text Route117_Text_BrandiDefeat {
    "Astonishing!"
}

text Route117_Text_BrandiIntro {
    "Let me demonstrate the power\nhidden within a PSYCHIC POKéMON!"
}

text Route117_Text_BrandiPostBattle {
    "PSYCHIC POKéMON are complex.\nYou should try catching some."
}

text Route117_Text_DerekDefeat {
    "My ineptitude also remains\nunchanged…"
}

text Route117_Text_DerekIntro {
    "Once a BUG CATCHER!\nAnd now a BUG MANIAC!\pBut my love for POKéMON remains\nunchanged!"
}

text Route117_Text_DerekPostBattle {
    "All I did was follow my heart, and now\nthey call me a BUG MANIAC…\pStill, I am an expert on BUG POKéMON,\nso it's only natural that they call me\na BUG MANIAC."
}

text Route117_Text_DylanDefeat {
    "I ran out of energy!"
}

text Route117_Text_DylanIntro {
    "I'm in the middle of a triathlon, but,\nwhatever, let's have a battle!"
}

text Route117_Text_DylanPostBattle {
    "I may have blown it…\pI might have dropped to last during\nthat battle…"
}

text Route117_Text_IsaacDefeat {
    "You've raised yours superbly…"
}

text Route117_Text_IsaacIntro {
    "Listen, could I get you to battle\nthe POKéMON I'm raising?"
}

text Route117_Text_IsaacPostBattle {
    "POKéMON isn't all about power.\pPolishing a unique aspect of one's\ncharacter is another way of enjoying\nPOKéMON."
}

text Route117_Text_LydiaDefeat {
    "Yes, they are growing properly."
}

text Route117_Text_LydiaIntro {
    "Please, allow me to evaluate if you\nhave raised your POKéMON properly."
}

text Route117_Text_LydiaPostBattle {
    "Try raising POKéMON with more\nattention to their character traits."
}

text Route117_Text_MariaDefeat {
    "I need to get more practices in,\nI guess."
}

text Route117_Text_MariaIntro {
    "I do my triathlon training with POKéMON,\nso I'm pretty confident about my speed."
}

text Route117_Text_MariaPostBattle {
    "Training is meaningful only if you\nkeep it up regularly.\pOkay! I'll resume my training!\nTomorrow!"
}

text Route117_Text_MelinaDefeat {
    "Oh, that's quite impressive!"
}

text Route117_Text_MelinaIntro {
    "Isn't it nice? To battle while looking\nat pretty flowers?"
}

text Route117_Text_MelinaPostBattle {
    "It feels wonderful to go for a jog\nwhile looking at flowers."
}